# Floor and ceiling for every numeric setting. Floors are inclusive:
# roof_fan_change_delay accepts 0 deliberately, so that "no hysteresis at all" stays
# available to anyone who wants it.
#
# This is not a defaults table. Nothing here supplies a value for a setting the operator
# has not entered -- an unset setting still reads as None, and every read site keeps the
# local fallback it already had. These only say which *entered* values are refused.
